{
  "info": {
    "name": "Going Twice: judge flow",
    "_postman_id": "6b0c7a52-9f3e-4c1e-8f61-0a1b2c3d4e5f",
    "description": "Live auction where every bidder's paddle is a PayPal authorization hold. Run the folders in order: create a room, register 3 test-card paddles + 1 absentee AI agent, bid, hammer, close. Tests assert the money rules: captures are below the holds, non-winners are voided, payout == captured.\n\nSet `baseUrl` in the environment (local `http://localhost:3510` or the Render URL). `room` is filled in by the first request.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Room",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create a fresh room",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test(\"room code\", () => pm.expect(j.room).to.match(/^[A-Z0-9]{6}$/));",
                  "pm.environment.set(\"room\", j.room);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"room\", j.room);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/room/new?room={{room}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "room",
                "new"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "room",
                  "value": "{{room}}"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Every run gets its own isolated auction room (?room=CODE), so judges never collide."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Reset the room (fresh charity gala, 4 lots)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const s = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test(\"lobby with lots and no paddles\", () => { pm.expect(s.status).to.eql(\"lobby\"); pm.expect(s.lots.length).to.be.above(2); pm.expect(s.paddles.length).to.eql(0); });",
                  "pm.test(\"demo/live mode reported\", () => pm.expect(s.demoMode).to.be.a(\"boolean\"));",
                  "console.log(s.demoMode ? \"DEMO mode (simulated PayPal)\" : \"LIVE PayPal sandbox: real authorization holds\");"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/reset?room={{room}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "reset"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "room",
                  "value": "{{room}}"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
